1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,870 --> 00:01:54,640
Snow is the sign of a good harvest !

25
00:01:54,390 --> 00:01:55,620
Take it, take it.

26
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:57,960
Brother, come by my house !

27
00:01:58,110 --> 00:01:59,080
Sure.

28
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,560
Happy New Year !

29
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:06,600
Uncle Wang !

30
00:02:06,670 --> 00:02:07,920
Happy New Year !

31
00:02:08,070 --> 00:02:10,080
How did you know we were coming ?

32
00:02:11,070 --> 00:02:12,120
Happy New Year.

33
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:19,120
Brother Wang,

34
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,280
are you busy ?

35
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:20,920
I'm free.

36
00:02:21,130 --> 00:02:22,480
Let's talk inside.

37
00:02:28,590 --> 00:02:29,760
This is the first time

38
00:02:29,510 --> 00:02:31,400
that I've seen him act like this.

39
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:34,610
He must need help for something.

40
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:36,560
Brother Ceng,

41
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:37,640
sit down.

42
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:40,560
If you have anything to ask, go ahead.

43
00:02:42,230 --> 00:02:44,260
It's fine, it's fine...

44
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:52,400
It's only borrowing some silver.

45
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:54,520
What's so embarrassing about it ?

46
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:56,360
Oh you...

47
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:58,090
wait until we are home.

48
00:02:59,270 --> 00:03:00,190
Fine,

49
00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:02,400
since Father won't speak, then I will.

50
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,960
Mother wants to buy the shop next to ours

51
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,640
to make our shop bigger,

52
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,400
but we don't have enough money.

53
00:03:08,150 --> 00:03:09,400
We want to borrow.

54
00:03:11,550 --> 00:03:12,720
Brother Wang,

55
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:14,120
my wife thinks

56
00:03:14,070 --> 00:03:15,760
that our shop is too small

57
00:03:15,510 --> 00:03:17,270
and that it limits our business.

58
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:20,310
She saw that old Li's shop is for rent

59
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,510
so she wanted it immediately.

60
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,160
How much do you need ?

61
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,560
The shop is pretty big

62
00:03:26,790 --> 00:03:28,750
and we have to pay 2 years of rent at once...

63
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,890
It would be...

64
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,240
50 taels of silver.

65
00:03:33,550 --> 00:03:34,520
30

66
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,010
30 taels is enough.

67
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,910
Mother clearly said 80.

68
00:03:53,950 --> 00:03:55,330
I don't need this much !

69
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:56,160
Brother Wang,

70
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:57,760
I only want to borrow 30 taels of silver.

71
00:03:57,950 --> 00:03:58,690
Brother Ceng,

72
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:01,760
I'm not lending you this money.

73
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,560
This is Da Niu's New Year's money

74
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:06,350
and it's also money for wine.

75
00:04:07,030 --> 00:04:08,920
I'd like to buy a jug of wine every day.

76
00:04:06,130 --> 00:04:07,250
From now on,

77
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:11,000
This money is worth 10 years of fruit wine.

78
00:04:12,950 --> 00:04:14,200
Brother Wang...

79
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:15,400
This...

80
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:16,390
Thank you, Uncle Wang !

81
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:20,760
This is the first time I've recieved so much at New Year !

82
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:23,320
This kid...

83
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:27,190
Thank you.

84
00:04:27,230 --> 00:04:29,070
Get up, Brother Ceng.

85
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,970
What's 10 years or 8 years ?

86
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,760
From now on, as long as you live here,

87
00:04:35,810 --> 00:04:38,760
I'll send you a jug of this wine every day !

88
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,960
I'll deliver it to Uncle Wang.

89
00:04:41,970 --> 00:04:43,080
Deal.

90
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:52,110
Goodbye Uncle Wang !

91
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,900
It's cold ouside,

92
00:04:50,670 --> 00:04:52,190
let's go back quickly.

93
00:05:00,470 --> 00:05:02,320
The 400 years of killing intent

94
00:05:02,710 --> 00:05:04,700
have been condensed into 4 beads.

95
00:05:05,230 --> 00:05:07,330
If I want to understand the heavens,

96
00:05:07,150 --> 00:05:09,010
I have to completely embrace

97
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,530
the life of a mortal

98
00:05:11,340 --> 00:05:12,600
for a lifetime.

99
00:05:16,140 --> 00:05:19,430
6 years later

100
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:37,720
If Teng Huayuan was still alive,

101
00:05:37,470 --> 00:05:39,360
he would never recognize

102
00:05:39,110 --> 00:05:40,600
that this mortal

103
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:42,360
and the all-powerful Wang Lin

104
00:05:42,110 --> 00:05:43,680
are the same person.

105
00:05:43,830 --> 00:05:44,760
Excuse me.

106
00:05:44,710 --> 00:05:45,520
Don't worry.

107
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,070
Please.

108
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:51,040
Uncle Wang said

109
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:53,600
that he had parents and a wife.

110
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,160
But for the past 6 years,

111
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:57,040
he's been all alone...

112
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:58,720
Uncle Wang !

113
00:05:58,910 --> 00:06:00,440
You're finally here.

114
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:01,640
If you don't come over by youself,

115
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:03,120
then I must invite you.

116
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,100
Here.

117
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,240
Thank you, Uncle Wang.

118
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,690
Here.

119
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,800
Brother Wang,

120
00:06:13,990 --> 00:06:15,730
this is your favorite beef sauce.

121
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:17,540
Eat more during the New Year.

122
00:06:19,670 --> 00:06:21,120
This beef is good for the stomach

123
00:06:20,870 --> 00:06:22,570
but you have to eat it with wine !

124
00:06:24,670 --> 00:06:25,610
Cheers !

125
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:32,730
This is the money you lent us before.

126
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:34,600
I want to return some of it.

127
00:06:34,350 --> 00:06:36,350
I told you before, it's for buying wine.

128
00:06:37,030 --> 00:06:38,310
No need to return it.

129
00:06:38,590 --> 00:06:39,450
Brother,

130
00:06:39,990 --> 00:06:41,530
you're an honest person.

131
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,210
Without your help,

132
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:45,100
we wouldn't be where we are today.

133
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:47,340
We will always take you in as our family.

134
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,240
We want to pay you back little by little,

135
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:51,010
this is to show our goodwill.

136
00:06:50,910 --> 00:06:51,890
My family

137
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,830
will never take advantage of you.

138
00:06:54,130 --> 00:06:55,270
That's right, Brother Wang.

139
00:06:55,710 --> 00:06:56,570
Uncle Wang,

140
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,690
don't worry.

141
00:06:57,790 --> 00:06:59,280
Although it's not as good as yours,

142
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:01,280
our business is also doing well.

143
00:07:04,230 --> 00:07:05,200
Let's go...

144
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,130
Happy New Year !

145
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:16,760
The market opened early this year !

146
00:07:17,150 --> 00:07:18,880
Boss, business is flourishing !

147
00:07:24,670 --> 00:07:25,910
Shopkeeper Wang,

148
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:26,770
Happy New Year.

149
00:07:27,260 --> 00:07:28,160
Please come in.

150
00:07:27,910 --> 00:07:29,400
I don't have silver for tips.

151
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:31,000
No matter how friendly you are.

152
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:33,440
Look at what you're saying.

153
00:07:33,190 --> 00:07:34,910
The manager has ordered that

154
00:07:34,710 --> 00:07:36,520
the first seat by the east window

155
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,690
is always reserved for you.

156
00:07:39,330 --> 00:07:40,770
Shopkeeper Wang,

157
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,570
this wine comes from overseas.

158
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,580
Please try it.

159
00:07:44,790 --> 00:07:45,560
Manager Li,

160
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,680
I'm not here to collect rent

161
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,120
so you can relax.

162
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,040
Business is not good lately.

163
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:55,050
I spent a lot of money hiring this troupe to perform.

164
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,960
Without you,

165
00:07:56,710 --> 00:07:59,650
and the 20 taels of gold you lent us last year,

166
00:07:59,670 --> 00:08:02,840
our theater would have been closed.

167
00:08:04,870 --> 00:08:07,560
This little lady sure sings well.

168
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:10,240
She lured me here from the north of the city.

169
00:08:10,810 --> 00:08:11,880
It's him...

170
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,680
Gooood !

171
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,640
What is this beggar doing here ? Go away !

172
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:15,600
I don't have money today.

173
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:17,000
You dare to touch me ?

174
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:18,680
If you touch me again,

175
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:20,800
I'll lie down here and never get up !

176
00:08:20,910 --> 00:08:23,120
I'm here to listen to the music !

177
00:08:24,790 --> 00:08:26,360
For the sake of the New Year,

178
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,240
I'll give you money.

179
00:08:27,470 --> 00:08:28,640
Now go away.

180
00:08:28,670 --> 00:08:29,720
Damn it.

181
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:31,800
It's a real one !

182
00:08:31,550 --> 00:08:32,600
It's harder than gold.

183
00:08:34,110 --> 00:08:36,530
It's your manager's idea.

184
00:08:37,550 --> 00:08:38,560
A pot of tea.

185
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:39,430
Forget it.

186
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:42,920
Shopkeeper Wang is kind.

187
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:45,210
I'll let you off the hook today.

188
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,280
Thank you.

189
00:08:53,990 --> 00:08:55,880
If no one guides you,

190
00:08:55,830 --> 00:08:58,560
I'm afraid you will never reach Soul Formation.

191
00:08:58,950 --> 00:09:01,250
What a pity, how pitiful...

192
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,840
It's you !

193
00:09:04,230 --> 00:09:05,150
Senior,

194
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:08,160
We haven't met in 7 years, you still look the same.

195
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:09,720
You became a mortal ?

196
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:13,920
You really turned into a mortal !

197
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:19,280
Good wine !

198
00:09:21,660 --> 00:09:25,110
I've seen countless cutivators forming their soul in my life.

199
00:09:25,230 --> 00:09:28,550
But you are the first one to be able to turn mortal

200
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,670
in just 6 years.

201
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:33,870
Not bad.

202
00:09:33,900 --> 00:09:35,350
It's not that

203
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:37,340
your flesh and blood are similar to a mortal

204
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:38,620
but your soul is.

205
00:09:39,180 --> 00:09:40,120
Young man,

206
00:09:40,260 --> 00:09:42,310
if you can experience a domain

207
00:09:42,350 --> 00:09:43,720
I promise that you will

208
00:09:43,470 --> 00:09:44,990
reach Soul Formation

209
00:09:45,230 --> 00:09:47,080
within 100 years.

210
00:09:46,830 --> 00:09:48,120
What is a domain ?

211
00:09:49,850 --> 00:09:50,510
Look,

212
00:09:50,830 --> 00:09:52,500
I'm getting old.

213
00:09:52,690 --> 00:09:54,230
When I get hungry,

214
00:09:54,410 --> 00:09:56,520
I can't remember anything.

215
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,480
But if you treat me to a meal,

216
00:09:58,260 --> 00:10:01,190
I'll tell you everything I remember.

217
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,480
Senior, take your time to enjoy the performance.

218
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:05,340
Junior is leaving.

219
00:10:10,300 --> 00:10:11,600
Interesting...

220
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:18,110
Not bad.

221
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,560
So this the place

222
00:10:20,310 --> 00:10:22,550
where you're turning mortal ?

223
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,340
Flood Dragon !?

224
00:10:27,470 --> 00:10:28,920
Flame Spider

225
00:10:29,540 --> 00:10:30,990
Heaven Noise Beast

226
00:10:32,540 --> 00:10:33,980
Zhong Gu

227
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,150
Eight-clawed Beast

228
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:37,160
Ti Lun !?

229
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:40,540
Not bad, young man.

230
00:10:40,730 --> 00:10:43,420
You managed to bring most of the beasts

231
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,820
from the Sea of Devils here.

232
00:10:48,300 --> 00:10:49,950
I really underestimated you.

233
00:10:50,070 --> 00:10:53,190
I never would have thought that you had such experience.

234
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:56,640
You wouldn't have been able to make these carvings

235
00:10:56,390 --> 00:10:59,210
of Soul Formation cultivators and Desolate beasts

236
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:02,880
if you hadn't fought them personally.

237
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,920
What's your name ?

238
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:08,600
Wang Lin

239
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:19,510
I can't see through his cultivation.

240
00:11:20,580 --> 00:11:22,340
He's probably higher than Soul Formation.

241
00:11:25,710 --> 00:11:26,400
Senior,

242
00:11:26,670 --> 00:11:27,720
my old house

243
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,440
cannot withstand your power.

244
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:31,080
Please restrain yourself.

245
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:33,430
Kid,

246
00:11:33,540 --> 00:11:34,790
experience it for a bit.

247
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:36,550
This is a domain.

248
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:51,590
This is my Raging Domain.

249
00:11:51,830 --> 00:11:53,320
I used this domain back then

250
00:11:53,070 --> 00:11:55,720
to reach Soul Formation.

251
00:11:56,420 --> 00:11:58,270
Under this domain,

252
00:11:58,500 --> 00:12:00,840
all spiritual energy and even your Nascent Soul

253
00:12:00,590 --> 00:12:02,600
will be assimilated

254
00:12:02,550 --> 00:12:04,560
and fall under my control.

255
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,320
A domain...

256
00:12:06,990 --> 00:12:09,240
So this is the power of a domain...

257
00:12:09,470 --> 00:12:10,520
Senior,

258
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:12,920
why have none of the Soul Formation cultivators I met before

259
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,150
displayed this kind of domain ?

260
00:12:15,230 --> 00:12:16,670
My bad, I forgot.

261
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:18,840
I lowered my cultivation to Soul Formation

262
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:20,720
but my domain upgraded at Soul Transformation

263
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:22,390
so it was a little too powerful.

264
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:26,840
Soul Formation cultivators don't display their domains.

265
00:12:26,590 --> 00:12:28,640
Only a sliver of it

266
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:31,140
is present in their spells.

267
00:12:31,070 --> 00:12:32,400
It's hard to detect.

268
00:12:32,950 --> 00:12:34,880
Based on your past achievements,

269
00:12:36,590 --> 00:12:39,920
if you experience more domains, you will break past Nascent Soul.

270
00:12:42,230 --> 00:12:43,120
What do you think ?

271
00:12:43,350 --> 00:12:46,040
How about I help you reach Soul Formation ?

272
00:12:45,790 --> 00:12:47,800
Senior, why are you helping me ?

273
00:12:49,070 --> 00:12:50,160
Well...

274
00:12:51,750 --> 00:12:54,520
I can tell that these carvings are pretty good.

275
00:12:55,190 --> 00:12:56,080
This...

276
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:56,930
Okay,

277
00:12:57,030 --> 00:12:58,760
I can give you all of these.

278
00:12:59,430 --> 00:13:02,240
What would I want your low quality carvings for ?

279
00:13:01,990 --> 00:13:05,060
Only those half finished carvings are worth looking at

280
00:13:05,030 --> 00:13:06,520
but I have no use for them.

281
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:07,360
Look...

282
00:13:08,190 --> 00:13:12,280
I'm handsome, bright and dominating.

283
00:13:12,590 --> 00:13:14,500
Did I move your heart ?

284
00:13:14,950 --> 00:13:16,320
Don't you think

285
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:19,120
I would make a very good model for a carving ?

286
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:20,990
Okay.

287
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:23,160
But my cultivation isn't high enough yet.

288
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:25,240
I failed making Soul Formation carvings,

289
00:13:24,990 --> 00:13:26,990
not to mention a Senior like you.

290
00:13:27,630 --> 00:13:29,400
Only after I reach Soul Formation,

291
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:31,740
can I make your carving perfect.

292
00:13:32,860 --> 00:13:34,640
There's no rush.

293
00:13:34,950 --> 00:13:36,360
You must make it perfect.

294
00:13:36,110 --> 00:13:39,360
I want a nude carving too, you must make it perfect !

295
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:41,720
And you've got to make more than one.

296
00:13:43,050 --> 00:13:44,110
I want a hundred !

297
00:13:44,150 --> 00:13:47,510
I will give my carvings to all the beautiful ladies.

298
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:50,740
We need to hurry up.

299
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:52,750
Hurry up ? For what ?

300
00:13:53,310 --> 00:13:56,350
To have you experience more domains of course.

301
00:13:56,350 --> 00:13:57,960
So you can reach Soul Formation.

302
00:14:12,270 --> 00:14:14,120
A teleportation of 100 000 li ?!

303
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:16,000
Late stage Nascent Soul

304
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:18,200
can only teleport up to 1000 li.

305
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:21,120
Can a Soul Transformation cross 100 000 ?

306
00:14:21,900 --> 00:14:23,950
What's his cultivation level ?

307
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:25,840
I'm getting old,

308
00:14:25,590 --> 00:14:27,320
my body is a lot worse than it used to be.

309
00:14:27,710 --> 00:14:29,240
This teleportation

310
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,400
only moved us 100 000 li.

311
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:34,190
I'm ashamed.

312
00:14:36,070 --> 00:14:36,750
Kid,

313
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:39,320
have you seen someone teleport this distance before ?

314
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,600
No.

315
00:14:40,950 --> 00:14:43,400
After seeing how powerful I am,

316
00:14:43,470 --> 00:14:45,500
you don't even let out a fart ?

317
00:14:46,170 --> 00:14:47,480
Senior's cultivation

318
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,320
is something Junior has never seen before.

319
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:50,520
I admire you !

320
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:54,360
That's the White Cloud Sect.

321
00:14:54,270 --> 00:14:56,870
Let's go, this old man will take you to trash that sect.

322
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:57,760
Senior,

323
00:14:57,830 --> 00:14:59,120
are we just going like this ?

324
00:15:00,470 --> 00:15:01,730
Wear this.

325
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:04,680
Unless someone is two full levels above you,

326
00:15:04,790 --> 00:15:07,840
they won't be able to see your appearance.

327
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:10,150
This is something I've saved for a long time.

328
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:12,950
You must return it to me when we're done.

329
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:18,550
This hat looks ordinary

330
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:20,920
but it has countless restrictions on it.

331
00:15:21,110 --> 00:15:23,230
The essence of these restrictions

332
00:15:22,990 --> 00:15:24,920
is comparable to ancient restrictions.

333
00:15:47,990 --> 00:15:49,550
What an overbearing technique.

334
00:15:50,270 --> 00:15:51,500
Goldy,

335
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,510
smash !

336
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:03,750
The formation of a rank 4 country,

337
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,360
was broken in a single blow.

338
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:20,220
That's it ? Disappearing already ?

339
00:16:20,670 --> 00:16:22,260
I fed you so many artifacts

340
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:23,660
and put effort in you every day !

341
00:16:23,430 --> 00:16:25,580
Yet you're too lazy to play around ?

342
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,870
Who destroyed the formation ?

343
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:33,960
This sect is worthy of a rank 4 country.

344
00:16:34,470 --> 00:16:35,750
There are more

345
00:16:35,910 --> 00:16:38,040
than 30 Nascent Souls cultivators.

346
00:16:39,110 --> 00:16:41,640
And those 5 are Soul Formation.

347
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:51,100
Wen Baoxin
White Cloud Sect Leader
Soul Formation

348
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:50,510
The two of you broke my White Cloud Sect's formation.

349
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,960
If you don't explain this

350
00:16:53,830 --> 00:16:55,440
then you are dead.

351
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,670
I don't care,

352
00:17:00,570 --> 00:17:02,360
I'm just a hired hand.

353
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:03,680
He asked me to come,

354
00:17:03,430 --> 00:17:04,750
talk to him.

355
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:31,860
I've had my share of wounds,

356
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,860
now I want to fight back.

357
00:17:31,690 --> 00:17:35,420
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

358
00:17:35,250 --> 00:17:41,340
that's blocking all my hopes

359
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:41,340
for life ?

360
00:17:42,890 --> 00:17:47,100
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

361
00:17:44,610 --> 00:17:47,100
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

362
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:50,500
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

363
00:17:50,610 --> 00:17:56,500
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

364
00:17:53,330 --> 00:17:56,500
out of reach.

365
00:17:57,610 --> 00:18:01,980
Immortals

366
00:17:58,650 --> 00:18:01,980
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

367
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:06,020
Renegades

368
00:18:02,770 --> 00:18:06,020
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

369
00:18:05,770 --> 00:18:09,860
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

370
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:09,860
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

371
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:13,980
because I don't see the harm in that.

372
00:18:15,730 --> 00:18:21,780
My new body opens its eyes

373
00:18:18,250 --> 00:18:21,780
and awakens from its dream.

374
00:18:21,650 --> 00:18:29,340
I have overcome many trials

375
00:18:23,770 --> 00:18:29,340
to get this body back.

376
00:18:29,290 --> 00:18:36,980
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

377
00:18:33,330 --> 00:18:36,980
I can still see.

378
00:18:37,130 --> 00:18:46,340
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

379
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:46,340
by my own hands.

380
00:19:16,970 --> 00:19:23,180
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

381
00:19:19,690 --> 00:19:23,180
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

382
00:19:22,930 --> 00:19:30,740
With a flick of a finger,

383
00:19:24,370 --> 00:19:30,740
only my indomitable heart remains.

384
00:19:30,530 --> 00:19:40,140
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

385
00:19:36,490 --> 00:19:40,140
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

386
00:19:40,130 --> 00:19:47,980
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

387
00:19:42,650 --> 00:19:47,980
like the descent of a god.
